{"id":"4743","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4743_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.jpeg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这层高积云很薄，足以显示太阳的位置（透光云类）。各元素之间存在许多间隙，看到天空（漏隙云云类）。细长元素的存在几乎彼此平行，表明了波状云云类。这一层快速地从<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">左</span>向<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">右</span>侵入天空。在塔楼的左侧和右侧可以看到淡积云，在右侧的地平线上方可以看到一片<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stanley Sharp","location":"南非伊丽莎白港伊丽莎白港中央6001","latitude":"纬度: 33° 57' 44'' S","longitude":"经度: 25° 36' 45'' E","date":"31 October 2015 1215 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 5, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.25","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.25"},{"src":"/images/original/upper/4743_upper_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>高空探测器在约5800米处有一层&gt; 85％RH的薄层。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5642_main_invading-altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>这是侵入天空的高积云薄（透光云类）云片（成层云种）的典型实例，其融合云素的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">长卷轴（波状云类）</span>正融合成<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">厚层上风向</span>。</p>\n<p>透过这些小<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">间隙（漏隙云类）</span>，可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">厚卷云块（密云种）</span>。</p>\n<p>附近的高空探测确认高积云5500米（18000英尺）相对高的云底。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Tze Ching Ho","location":"中国，辽宁，本溪","latitude":"纬度: 41° 29' 32'' N","longitude":"经度: 123° 41' 23'' E","date":"29 September 2015 1635 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 5, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.11","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.11"}]}]}